## Why This Is Asked
This assesses building and operating a multilingual, privacy-conscious NLP service with real-time constraints and governance.

## Key Concepts
- Edge/on-prem inference, latency budgeting, quantization
- Privacy-preserving annotation and differential privacy
- Multilingual claim extraction and knowledge-graph integration
- Cross-language evidence fusion and drift detection
- Auditable rollback and access controls

